display case.

00:04:29.167 --> 00:04:31.934
[ Laughter and applause ]
Like, how old is that sucker?

00:04:31.934 --> 00:04:33.434
-Krrkh!
-[ Smoker's voice ]
What year is it?

00:04:33.434 --> 00:04:35.534
[ Laughter ]
Some entertainment news --

00:04:35.534 --> 00:04:37.701
there's a new Smurfs movie
in the works

00:04:37.701 --> 00:04:41.567
[ Cheering and applause ]
and Rihanna has signed on
to do the voice of Smurfette.

00:04:41.567 --> 00:04:44.434
[ Cheering and applause ]
-Ooh.

00:04:44.434 --> 00:04:46.934
-They already released
an early clip and I think

00:04:46.934 --> 00:04:48.334
