00:04:53.801 --> 00:04:55.300
-♪ Bitch better have my money ♪

00:04:55.300 --> 00:04:56.534
[ Laughter and applause ]
-Yeah, just interesting.

00:04:56.534 --> 00:04:58.434
Different take,
-Wow.

00:04:58.434 --> 00:05:00.100
-Different take on it,
but looks good.

00:05:05.033 --> 00:05:07.100
Kids are going to love it.
-Kids are going to love it 100%.

00:05:07.100 --> 00:05:08.767
[ Laughter ]
Guys, I saw

00:05:08.767 --> 00:05:12.100
a new mermaid statue in Italy
is causing controversy

00:05:12.100 --> 00:05:14.033
because some people think
it's too provocative.

00:05:14.033 --> 00:05:15.767
I'm going to show you a picture.
Take a look at this.

00:05:15.767 --> 00:05:17.234
Wow.
-Ooh.

00:05:17.234 --> 00:05:18.501
[ Laughter ]

00:05:18.501 --> 00:05:19.567
It was made by the artist

00:05:19.567 --> 00:05:21.033
